[彭博社] 雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</link><description>Rystad Energy表示，随着乌克兰继续袭击炼油厂，俄罗斯的石油加工率已降至二十多年来的最低水平，给该国国内燃料供应带来压力。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says'&gt;雷斯塔称，俄罗斯炼油厂运行跌至数十年来最低水平&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Russian Refinery Runs Plunge to Lowest in Decades, Rystad Says&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/russian-refinery-runs-plunge-to-lowest-in-decades-rystad-says</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:38:16 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[纽约时报] 范霍伦对舒默的挑战凸显了以色列的民主分歧</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/van-hollen-schumer-israel-senate.html</link><description>参议员克里斯·范·霍伦表示，他取代参议员查克·舒默担任党魁的举动与以色列无关，但他对犹太国家的尖锐批评立场已成为竞选中的主要断层线。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/van-hollen-schumer-israel-senate.html'&gt;范霍伦对舒默的挑战凸显了以色列的民主分歧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Van Hollen’s Challenge to Schumer Highlights Democratic Rift on Israel&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/van-hollen-schumer-israel-senate.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:41:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</link><description>CoreWeave Inc. 和 Nvidia Corp. 的信用风险指标周三创下历史新高，同时，随着华尔街对科技行业为人工智能融资而创纪录的借贷越来越担忧，人们的担忧情绪再次达到 3 月份的水平。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount'&gt;随着人工智能担忧加剧，CoreWeave 和 Nvidia 信用风险创下新高&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CoreWeave, Nvidia Credit Risk Hit Fresh Highs as AI Fears Mount&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-nvidia-credit-risk-hit-fresh-highs-as-ai-fears-mount</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:44:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] Anthropic 首次公开募股后的困境与 SpaceX 的早期形成鲜明对比</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days</link><description>Anthropic PBC 正在经历比 SpaceX 更艰难的上市进程，在这家克劳德开发商明年初首次作为上市公司发布报告之前，一系列市场和技术因素可能会拖累其股票表现。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days'&gt;Anthropic 首次公开募股后的困境与 SpaceX 的早期形成鲜明对比&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic’s Post-IPO Struggles Contrast With SpaceX’s Early Days&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/anthropic-s-post-ipo-struggles-contrast-with-spacex-s-early-days</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:45:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[路透社] 据《华尔街日报》报道，美国没有发现任何证据表明中国指示高管监视英伟达首席执行官</title><link>https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNb1ZBby1iVDJnTmJwX3hDYWJpU2lxTUdLTHdlWHFqRHJUcmtTOWFuQkFRTlUyZTJBcGdNMWR3N3d1YlJIV05kWk1mU21JSDZmSVpZR1BlanpqRzFXSkg3NkxkeElWcHM0Q2Y4eFJKb3Fha29XakxYNFJ4cXExZHo4MFVDOHdDbENrQWs0d0lqQ3Z5cEVDRVBQR1hNNWZxSmhiUll4NFg1amZlU01oWm9fN2hkUFBBNkdKT21v?oc=5</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[路透社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNb1ZBby1iVDJnTmJwX3hDYWJpU2lxTUdLTHdlWHFqRHJUcmtTOWFuQkFRTlUyZTJBcGdNMWR3N3d1YlJIV05kWk1mU21JSDZmSVpZR1BlanpqRzFXSkg3NkxkeElWcHM0Q2Y4eFJKb3Fha29XakxYNFJ4cXExZHo4M