town, Iowa&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/us-army-detonates-explosives-cache-in-middletown-iowa-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:11:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 迈克尔·伯里 (Michael Burry) 抛售纳斯达克看跌期权后，做多多于做空</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts</link><description>科技股的抛售使得投资者迈克尔·伯里(Michael Burry)在抛售以科技股为主的纳斯达克100指数的看跌期权后，他的股票多头头寸多于空头头寸。迈克尔·伯里因2008年做空美国抵押贷款市场而闻名。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts'&gt;迈克尔·伯里 (Michael Burry) 抛售纳斯达克看跌期权后，做多多于做空&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Michael Burry Is More Long Than Short After Dumping Nasdaq Puts&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/michael-burry-is-more-long-than-short-after-dumping-nasdaq-puts</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:18:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 黄金因加息前景和人工智能股票抛售而暴跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video</link><description>由于股市持续抛售以及关键的通胀数据增强了对美联储进一步加息的押注，金价跌破每盎司 3,500 美元。金价下跌 3.7%，至每盎司 3,426.77 美元。近期金价暴跌步伐加快，上周金价暴跌近9%，有望连续第三个月跌幅超过6%。彭博社的迈克·麦格隆 (Mike McGlone) 加入讨论。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video'&gt;黄金因加息前景和人工智能股票抛售而暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps on Rate Hike Outlook, AI Stocks Selloff&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/gold-slumps-on-rate-hike-outlook-ai-stocks-selloff-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:20:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 市场中值得庆幸的一件事</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for</link><description>国债对冲再次发挥作用。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for'&gt;市场中值得庆幸的一件事&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：One Thing In Markets To Be Thankful For&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/one-thing-in-markets-to-be-thankful-for</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:23:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] CoreWeave 的银行下周将出售 45 亿美元的元挂钩贷款</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week</link><description>CoreWeave Inc. 的摩根士丹利和三菱日联金融集团银行家最快将于下周准备出售 45 亿美元的贷款，融资由 Meta Platforms Inc. 的图形处理部门提供担保。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week'&gt;CoreWeave 的银行下周将出售 45 亿美元的元挂钩贷款&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：CoreWeave’s Banks to Sell $4.5 Billion Meta-Tied Loan Next Week&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/coreweave-s-banks-to-sell-4-5-billion-meta-tied-loan-next-week</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:25:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[金融时报] 美国财政部金融犯罪监管机构遭受疑似网络攻击</title><link>https://www.ft.com/content/43aa7321-2a95-463c-8cb9-77fcc7e39291?syn-25a6b1a6=1</link><description>由于对技术系统漏洞的担忧日益加剧，FinCen 在检测到未经授权的访问后使系统离线&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/43aa7321-2a95-463c-8cb9-77fcc7e39291?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;美国财政部金融犯罪监管机构遭受疑似网络攻击&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Treasury financial crime watchdog hit by susp